\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"},{"content_hash":"38d946da1746f28f62710bd1460562daba3a282c62c0f4877d6926699dfabc67","event_uuid":"53f5cdbe-d215-4bff-97f7-14cb380fedd3","position":{"commit_sha":"08761090bb9ae3b0f920d82ddf9a01af2557671a","position":"1795256177245868001-53f5cdbe-d215-4bff-97f7-14cb380fedd3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-311_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"05f74084-8156-4489-b43f-fbb9222cdc20","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Reproduction (Nov 21 2026, macOS, 1.2 s-per-start git shim ahead of the fixture's wrapper): before, the healthy test fails with SnapshotError 'git remote ... timed out after 1s'; after the change, 1 passed in 15.40 s. Module: 6 passed.","timestamp":1795254837575776001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implemented per the review's advisory: the fixture now shrinks _GIT_TIMEOUT only when a subcommand is armed (as the sibling fix does), and the healthy test no longer arms one, so it runs with the wrapper on PATH under the production bound. 1.2 s-per-start shim: 1 passed in 15.14 s (before: timed out after 1s). Module: 6 passed.","timestamp":1795256177245868001}],"created_at":1795254557104266001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5e02c328-64f9-4baf-bbc0-a88571c7c125","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"5f0a-175b-946f-41a2"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n`tests/unit/test_snapshot_git_watchdog_d33f.py::test_healthy_calls_still_answer` failed in a Windows sweep (run 44885970695, job 136791396098, Nov 21 2026, branch tmp/f2-win-afunix-05f74084 at d8aa30bc2af): `SnapshotError: git remote in '...\\\\repo' timed out after 1s`. The scheduled main sweep 44877036143 passed it.\n\n## Root cause (from the code)\nThe `slow_git` fixture monkeypatches `git_fetch._GIT_TIMEOUT` to `_BOUND_S = 1` for the whole test, and the healthy test then makes 4 real git calls (`has_remote` twice, `resolve_ref`, `rev_parse`) that must each answer within 1 s. That holds on an idle host but not on a loaded one: a Windows git start alone can approach a second. Same class as closed civil-fameless-starfish (a healthy recovery call held to the shrunken 1 s bound).\n\n## Approach\nIn `test_healthy_calls_still_answer`, after arming the fixture with an unrelated subcommand, restore the module's production bound (`monkeypatch.setattr(git_fetch, \"_GIT_TIMEOUT\", <value saved before the fixture shrank it>)`) so the healthy calls are judged against the bound production uses. The slowed-subcommand tests keep the 1 s bound, which is what they test. The fixture records the original value as an attribute of the setter it returns, so the test does not hard-code it.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_snapshot_git_watchdog_d33f.py`\n\n## Testing\n- Reproduction: a PATH git shim that sleeps 1.2 s before every start makes the healthy test fail with `timed out after 1s` before the change and pass after; both runs recorded here.\n- The module's other tests (the watchdog-timeout assertions) still pass unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Under the 1.2 s-per-start shim the healthy test fails before and passes after, runs recorded here.\n- [ ] The slowed-subcommand tests still use the 1 s bound and pass.\n- [ ] `make verify` passes and Gerrit gives Verified +1.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_snapshot_git_watchdog_d33f.py","reason":"healthy-call test uses the production git bound"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"3841620a-343f-4c04-8e63-07e173374c3e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"b9a4-afea-0a35-47f5","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Snapshot watchdog healthy-call test holds real git to the shrunken 1 s bound and times out on a loaded Windows runner","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["27d19a44-f07b-4c9c-9548-f04691c96acf","5e02c328-64f9-4baf-bbc0-a88571c7c125","26cd2724-ae5c-42a0-bcf5-51062d6d2571","c8b529fa-bf52-45c0-8006-846854a53b82","2cc4ce6f-836c-47a5-8769-e45dc1a1f8d5","3841620a-343f-4c04-8e63-07e173374c3e","6e049b59-41f6-463b-903f-4d38ef1a27b2","53f5cdbe-d215-4bff-97f7-14cb380fedd3"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795256177245868002,"uuid":"37e5f6ed-1cc7-402d-8513-de3b2bc04b3e"}